[00:00.00]Across Chinese social platforms, a wave of Gen Z users has started swapping their avatars for Kris Jenner.
[00:07.15]Not for aesthetics, but as a lighthearted lucky charm to "manifest" success.The trend has been circulating on platforms like Rednote, where users claim that adopting Jenner's image can bring confidence, career momentum, and even financial luck.
[00:22.20]The logic isn't rooted in superstition alone.
[00:25.50]Jenner's long-standing reputation as a hands-on business figure has made her a symbol of discipline and ambition, qualities that resonate strongly with younger users navigating competitive work and school environments.
